OL,3,AChrista Pike's prognosis still unclear
OL,4,Aafter failed execution, lawyer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS murderer Christa Pike remains
OL,7,Fcritically ill in hospital and her
OL,8,Fprognosis is still unclear following
OL,9,Fher failed execution, her lawyer has
OL,10,Fsaid on Sunday.
OL,12,FSpeaking to CNN on Sunday morning,
OL,13,FPike's lawyer Stephen Ferrell said
OL,14,Fdoctors were still trying to clear two
OL,15,Fdoses of pentobarbital from her body.
OL,17,FPike, 50, was sentenced to death
OL,18,Ffollowing her conviction for murdering
OL,19,FColleen Slemmer in 1995.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
